  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><p data-lake-id=\"ue9f1573f\" id=\"ue9f1573f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u47711eb9\" id=\"u47711eb9\">对话框是为了更好地实现人与程序的交互<br />对话框主要是完成特定场景下的功能,比如删除确认等</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8b367e1b\" id=\"u8b367e1b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4518b0c4\" id=\"u4518b0c4\">QDialog的子类有</span><code data-lake-id=\"u67c77ea5\" id=\"u67c77ea5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0dc68cdf\" id=\"u0dc68cdf\">QMessageBox</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua682720d\" id=\"ua682720d\">、</span><code data-lake-id=\"uedcf33fc\" id=\"uedcf33fc\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua02d29e7\" id=\"ua02d29e7\">QFileDialog</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u594afe76\" id=\"u594afe76\">、</span><code data-lake-id=\"u584fb0dd\" id=\"u584fb0dd\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc68575be\" id=\"uc68575be\">QFontDialog</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue5ac514c\" id=\"ue5ac514c\">、</span><code data-lake-id=\"u6344420a\" id=\"u6344420a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4a003900\" id=\"u4a003900\">QInputDialog</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u14406a40\" id=\"u14406a40\">等</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"dMELS\" id=\"dMELS\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf2f06681\" id=\"uf2f06681\">1. QMessageBox</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uf7788d92\" id=\"uf7788d92\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8718577d\" id=\"u8718577d\">QMessageBox是普通的对话框</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc43944f5\" id=\"uc43944f5\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1685239520843-3333c4bc-0cbe-4d3f-baf5-382594569b0f.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ub0dc8ef9-d820-40d4-a7d3-bec1c3bf5f8%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ucea2ce82-e5c5-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A513.6%2C%22height%22%3A415%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A12880%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A642%2C%22originHeight%22%3A519%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22